  evidence:
  - evidence_type: CURATOR_JUDGMENT
    source: https://www.dsmz.de/microorganisms/medium/pdf/DSMZ_Medium1107.pdf
    notes: The original DSMZ1107 recipe explicitly describes a 5% w/v Cystein-HCl
      x 2 H2O stock, filter sterilized and kept oxygen-free. This bounded preparation
      preserves the source dihydrate claim and unresolved stereochemistry without
      changing either to a monohydrate or L-only chemical identity. Only the three
      Dialister/DSMZ1107 occurrences are linked; the three DSMZ375 contexts use a
      sterile anoxic stock of unspecified strength and retain unresolved chemical
      identity; this5%w/v record does not resolve that stock. No verified exact eligible
      ontology term or existing whole-preparation owner was established by the bounded
      source/owner review. This self-registry mapping represents the preparation,
      not its individual constituents.
