  unspecified strength and retain unresolved chemical identity; this5%w/v record does
  not resolve that stock. Raw source labels and original occurrence IDs remain in
  the evidence ledger; no recipe-local label is activated as a global synonym. All
  inherited release holds remain. DSMZ375 and DSMZ1107 may overlap in full material
  composition, but375 does not establish5%strength, solvent, filtration or exact solute
  form. This1107 record remains limited to its three original occurrences; no material
  disjointness or whole-formulation equality is asserted.
